{"id": "unknown-2026-07-03-004", "date": "2026-07-03", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 27, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.25, "keywords": ["leading", "[否定]improve"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "EFTA, Vietnam wrap up comprehensive FTA negotiations", "content": " EFTA and Vietnam have concluded negotiations on a comprehensive Free Trade Agreement covering goods, services, investment, intellectual property, government procurement, rules of origin and sustainable development. \nThe agreement aims to reduce trade barriers, improve market access and strengthen economic cooperation. \nFootwear and apparel remain among the EFTA's leading imports from Vietnam. ", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/efta-vietnam-wrap-up-comprehensive-fta-negotiations-311442-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-03-005", "date": "2026-07-03", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 27, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "India’s home textile exports fall 20% as China holds 43% share", "content": "TexPro data show India’s home-textile recovery is lagging despite broader textile export resilience.\nUS imports fell 20 per cent YTD, while India’s bed linen, terry towels and blankets remain well below trend.\nChina continues to dominate key markets, indicating that trade deals and cotton-duty relief alone are unlikely to revive demand without stronger retail recovery.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/india-s-home-textile-exports-fall-20-as-china-holds-43-share-311440-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-03-006", "date": "2026-07-03", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 27, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["order_visibility", "supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": -0.17, "keywords": ["leading", "decline", "weak"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Upland, Pima cotton export decline sharply: USDA", "content": "US cotton export sales weakened in the week ended June 25, with Upland bookings falling 42 per cent week on week and Pima sales dropping to a marketing-year low, USDA data showed.\nUpland shipments also declined, while Pima exports climbed to a seasonal high. Vietnam, India and Pakistan remained the leading destinations for US cotton exports.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/upland-pima-cotton-export-decline-sharply-usda-311445-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-03-007", "date": "2026-07-03", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 27, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["cotton_price"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.5, "keywords": ["weak"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "ICE cotton ends lower on weak US export report", "content": "ICE cotton futures snapped a three-day rally, with the December 2026 contract settling 0.92 per cent lower at 77.12 cents/lb as weak US export sales outweighed support from a softer dollar.\nDespite the fall, the contract gained 74 points for the week.\nAnalysts expect prices to remain range-bound between 75 and 80 cents amid sluggish demand and thin holiday trading.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/ice-cotton-ends-lower-on-weak-us-export-report-311438-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-03-008", "date": "2026-07-03", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 27, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Bharat Tex 2026 to showcase India's textile strength globally", "content": "Bharat Tex 2026 will bring together over 7,000 buyers, 1.3 lakh trade visitors and 1,600 exhibitors, reinforcing India's position as a global textile sourcing and investment hub.\nWith 3,500 curated B2B meetings, 100-plus knowledge sessions, international delegations and strong state participation, the event is set to boost trade, sourcing, investment, innovation and global partnerships.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/bharat-tex-2026-to-showcase-india-s-textile-strength-globally-311429-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-03-009", "date": "2026-07-03", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 27, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Bangladesh’s banking crisis: The $15.6bn supplier exposure map", "content": "TexPro data show global textile suppliers carry $15.65bn in annualised L/C exposure to Bangladesh, a payment system now running through a banking sector with 35.73 per cent NPLs. \nEvery top 12 supplier country cut Q1 exposure YoY except the United States, up 53.7 per cent to $101 million. \nThe divergence is the market’s first clear counterparty-risk signal, and it is already being paid. ", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/bangladesh-s-banking-crisis-the-15-6bn-supplier-exposure-map-311434-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
